\path (0.04,3.141593) node[right,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\pi$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Given $\arcsin\frac12=\frac{\pi}{6}$, $\arccos\frac12=\frac{\pi}{3}$ and $\arctan\frac1{\sqrt3}=\frac{\pi}{6}$:
(a) find $\arcsin\left(-\frac12\right)$, $\arccos\left(-\frac12\right)$ and $\arctan\left(-\frac1{\sqrt3}\right)$;
(b) determine the exact value of $3\arcsin\left(-\frac12\right)-\arccos\left(-\frac12\right)+\arcsin\frac12$.

